This file marks _template as a non-buildable scaffold. Turbo + Vercel ignore
this app because its package.json has no `dev` filter listed at the root and
its imports are illustrative only.

To convert this template into a real app:
1. Copy the directory: cp -r apps/_template apps/<your-app>
2. Delete this file: rm apps/<your-app>/.skip-build
3. Rename per apps/<your-app>/README.md.
